msgid "Transparent bridge"
msgstr "透明网桥"

msgid "Turns this router into a layer-2 bridge between its physical ports. Clients behind it keep the upstream router's subnet, gateway and NAT; no second layer of address translation is introduced."
msgstr "把路由器变成物理网口之间的二层网桥。其后的客户端沿用上级路由器的网段、网关与 NAT，不再引入第二层地址转换。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Enable transparent bridge"
msgstr "启用透明网桥"

msgid "Upstream gateway"
msgstr "上级网关"

msgid "Address of the router that provides this network's gateway and DNS."
msgstr "提供本网络网关与 DNS 的上游路由器地址。"

msgid "Management address"
msgstr "管理地址"

msgid "Must sit in the upstream router's subnet and must not collide with another device. This is the address you use to reach this web interface once the bridge is on."
msgstr "必须与上级路由器在同一网段，且不能与其他设备冲突。开启网桥后，用这个地址访问本管理界面。"

msgid "Netmask"
msgstr "子网掩码"

msgid "Number of physical ports"
msgstr "物理网口数量"

msgid "Leave empty to bridge every detected eth* port."
msgstr "留空则把所有探测到的 eth* 网口都加入网桥。"

msgid "What enabling does"
msgstr "启用后会做什么"

msgid "<li>The current network and DHCP configuration is saved once to /etc/bridge, so turning the switch off restores it.</li><li>All physical ports are put into one bridge, which then carries the management address.</li><li>Firewall rules are kept, not erased. Bridged traffic is switched at layer 2 and never reaches these zones.</li><li>Some router-only features stop applying while the bridge is on, for example multi-dial and full-cone NAT.</li><li>If the web interface becomes unreachable, connect to the management address shown above.</li>"
msgstr "<li>当前网络与 DHCP 配置会先备份一份到 /etc/bridge，关闭开关时据此还原。</li><li>所有物理网口被放入同一个网桥，管理地址由该网桥承载。</li><li>防火墙规则会保留，不会被清空。网桥流量在二层转发，不经过这些区域。</li><li>开启网桥后，部分仅路由模式才有的功能会失效，例如多拨、全锥 NAT 等。</li><li>如果网页界面无法访问，请连接到上方显示的管理地址。</li>"

msgid "RUNNING"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "NOT RUNNING"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Collecting data..."
msgstr "正在收集数据…"
